Abbreviation:
  a TranslationTiling.Abstract.Point is
    a function from indices in [0, 3) to ℤ.

Abbreviation:
  a TranslationTiling.Abstract.Prototile is
    a list of Point elements.

Definition:
  elements p and q of Point are TranslationTiling.Abstract.Adjacent if
    (the sum over indices i in [0, 3) of |p i - q i| = 1).

Definition:
  an element P of Prototile is TranslationTiling.Abstract.Connected if
    for every element x of Point where x ∈ P:
      for every element y of Point where y ∈ P:
        Relation.ReflTransGen
          (the function mapping an element p of Point and an element q of Point to
              p ∈ P and q ∈ P and Adjacent p q)
          x y.

Definition:
  an element P of Prototile is TranslationTiling.Abstract.Tiles if
    there is a set T of Point elements such that
      for every element x of Point:
        there is a unique element t of Point such that
          t ∈ T and x - t ∈ P.

Theorem TranslationTiling.Abstract.tiling_coRE_complete:
  (the function mapping an element P of Prototile to
    P is Connected and P is Tiles) is LeanWang.Abstract.CoREComplete

Theorem TranslationTiling.Abstract.tiling_undecidable:
  (the function mapping an element P of Prototile to
    P is Connected and P is Tiles) is not computable

Abbreviation:
  a TranslationTiling.Abstract.RealPoint is
    a function from indices in [0, 3) to ℝ.

Definition:
  TranslationTiling.Abstract.Solid is
    the function mapping an element P of Prototile to
      the set of elements x of RealPoint such that
        there is an element p of Point such that
          p ∈ P and (for every index i in [0, 3):
            p i as a real number ≤ x i and x i ≤ p i as a real number + 1).

Definition:
  an element P of Prototile is TranslationTiling.Abstract.RealTiles if
    there is a set T of RealPoint elements such that
      for almost every element x of RealPoint:
        there is a unique element t of RealPoint such that
          t ∈ T and x - t ∈ Solid P.

Theorem TranslationTiling.Abstract.real_tiling_coRE_complete:
  (the function mapping an element P of Prototile to
    P is Connected and P is RealTiles) is LeanWang.Abstract.CoREComplete

Theorem TranslationTiling.Abstract.real_tiling_undecidable:
  (the function mapping an element P of Prototile to
    P is Connected and P is RealTiles) is not computable
